# trompeloeil holds one lock of its own through every mocked call, its
# actions included. A case that calls back into the code under test from a
# mocked call, as one does to record while a wait is under way, takes that
# code's lock under trompeloeil's, which the thread sanitizer reports as an
# inversion. That lock exists only in the tests, so no cycle through it can
# happen outside them.
deadlock:trompeloeil::get_lock
